; SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0
; disclosures.vla - the fine print: the Disclosures sheet, a disclosure a row, of which
; the game shows one a month at the foot of its views (docs/OMAKASE.md, MENU.1). Words
; alone: one macro named after this file, whose body is one call of the library's
; strings. The source includes this file after its manifest, with every other include,
; and calls (disclosures) where the sheet's rows belong. To add a row, read README.md
; beside this file: one line, in the voice of a fund's compliance department, approved
; by a reviewer.

(defmacro (disclosures)
  "the fine print: the Disclosures sheet, a disclosure a row"
  (strings "Disclosures"            ; the sheet, hidden among the tabs
    ("disclosure" 100)              ; its one field: the header over its texts, and its width in characters
    ; each row: the disclosure
    ("Past performance is not indicative of future results, but history has proven (slightly) less coy than the future.")
    ("Buffet is not a financial advisor. Buffet is barely a game.")
    ("All investments carry risk; some investments also carry a reward.")
    ("Buffet is not FDIC-insured. Is the FDIC FDIC-insured? Food for thought.")
    ("Diversification does not ensure a profit; it ensures you will be wrong in several places simultaneously.")
    ("Forward-looking statements are predictions about the future. (see also: divintion, prognostication, augury, etc.)")
    ("This is not a recommendation to buy or sell. 'Ursi et tauri, cavete!'.")
    ("Your capital is at risk, but our fees are not.")
    ))                              ; the sheet's end: a row added goes on a line above this one
